{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-linear-algebra","title":"数值线性代数与矩阵计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/numerical-linear-algebra","wordCount":1557,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数值线性代数与矩阵计算\">数值线性代数与矩阵计算</h1><p>矩阵分解是几乎所有科学计算问题的计算核心——微分方程的隐式求解器需要 LU 分解，最小二乘拟合依赖 QR 分解，主成分分析使用奇异值分解。Julia 的 LinearAlgebra 标准库提供了对 BLAS/LAPACK 的完整封装，同时通过多重派发机制使得稀疏矩阵、带状矩阵、对称矩阵等特殊结构可以自动选择最优算法——无需用户手动指定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>线性代数计算的核心决策只有两个：<strong>用哪种分解</strong>，以及<strong>分解一次还是反复分解</strong>。前者由矩阵的结构属性决定——对称正定用 Cholesky、一般方阵用 LU、矩形最小二乘用 QR、需要秩信息用 SVD；Julia 的 <code>factorize</code> 正是把这一判断自动化：它读取矩阵类型携带的结构信息（<code>Symmetric</code>、稀疏、带状），经多重派发选中最优算法。后者则是性能的分水岭——分解是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，回代只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，因此「分解-求解分离」能带来数量级的差异。当矩阵规模超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，显式分解的内存与时间成本不再可接受，问题转入迭代求解器与预条件的领域：算法退化为矩阵-向量乘法，收敛速度则完全由预条件器的质量决定。下文沿稠密分解、BLAS/LAPACK 接口、稀疏结构、迭代求解、统一接口与矩阵函数逐层展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稠密矩阵分解体系\">稠密矩阵分解体系</h2><p>Julia 的 <code>factorize</code> 函数会根据矩阵的结构属性自动选择最优分解算法。以下是 LinearAlgebra 标准库支持的核心分解类型及其适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分解类型</th>\n<th>Julia 函数</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>数值稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LU</td>\n<td><code>lu(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3/3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>一般方阵线性系统</td>\n<td>部分选主元保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cholesky</td>\n<td><code>cholesky(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3/6)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/6</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对称正定矩阵</td>\n<td>天然稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>QR</td>\n<td><code>qr(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(2mn^2/3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最小二乘、矩形系统</td>\n<td>数值正交性保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SVD</td>\n<td><code>svd(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(4mn^2 + 8n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>秩分析、压缩、伪逆</td>\n<td>最高精度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Eigen</td>\n<td><code>eigen(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>特征值问题、稳定性分析</td>\n<td>依赖矩阵条件数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schur</td>\n<td><code>schur(A)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>矩阵函数、控制理论</td>\n<td>QR 迭代保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using LinearAlgebra&#10;&#10;A = rand(1000, 1000)&#10;A = A&#39;A  # 构造对称正定矩阵&#10;&#10;# factorize 自动识别对称正定 → 选择 Cholesky&#10;F = factorize(Symmetric(A))  # Cholesky 分解&#10;&#10;# 解线性系统：利用已有分解，避免重复计算&#10;x = F \\ rand(1000)&#10;&#10;# 多次求解不同右端项时，分解只需计算一次&#10;for b in eachcol(B)&#10;    x = F \\ b  # O(n²) 回代，而非 O(n³) 重新分解&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using LinearAlgebra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = rand(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = A'A  # 构造对称正定矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># factorize 自动识别对称正定 → 选择 Cholesky</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>F = factorize(Symmetric(A))  # Cholesky 分解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 解线性系统：利用已有分解，避免重复计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = F \\ rand(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多次求解不同右端项时，分解只需计算一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for b in eachcol(B)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x = F \\ b  # O(n²) 回代，而非 O(n³) 重新分解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Julia 的分解对象是延迟计算的封装——<code>lu(A)</code> 返回的 <code>LU</code> 对象同时包含 L、U 矩阵和置换信息，且后续的 <code>\\</code> 运算直接使用分解结果。这种设计让分解-求解分离成为自然的编程模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"blas-与-lapack-的底层接口\">BLAS 与 LAPACK 的底层接口</h2><p>Julia 默认链接 OpenBLAS，但可通过 <code>BLAS.set_num_threads()</code> 控制并行度，或替换为 MKL（通过 MKL.jl 包）。直接访问 BLAS Level 1/2/3 操作的接口在 <code>LinearAlgebra.BLAS</code> 模块中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using LinearAlgebra&#10;&#10;# BLAS Level 3：矩阵乘法的原地版本&#10;C = zeros(1000, 1000)&#10;A = rand(1000, 500)&#10;B = rand(500, 1000)&#10;&#10;# α*A*B + β*C → C，零分配&#10;BLAS.gemm!(&#39;N&#39;, &#39;N&#39;, 1.0, A, B, 0.0, C)&#10;&#10;# 5-argument mul! 是更 Julia 风格的等价写法&#10;mul!(C, A, B, 1.0, 0.0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using LinearAlgebra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># BLAS Level 3：矩阵乘法的原地版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>C = zeros(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = rand(1000, 500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>B = rand(500, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># α*A*B + β*C → C，零分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BLAS.gemm!('N', 'N', 1.0, A, B, 0.0, C)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 5-argument mul! 是更 Julia 风格的等价写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mul!(C, A, B, 1.0, 0.0)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BLAS 操作的性能关键在于<strong>线程数配置</strong>与<strong>矩阵尺寸阈值</strong>。对于小矩阵（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &lt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>），BLAS 的线程启动开销可能超过计算本身——此时 StaticArrays.jl 的栈分配方案更优。对于大矩阵，MKL 在 Intel 平台上通常比 OpenBLAS 快 20-40%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"稀疏矩阵与特殊结构\">稀疏矩阵与特殊结构</h2><p>科学计算中的大规模矩阵通常是稀疏的——有限元网格、图的邻接矩阵、偏微分方程的离散化矩阵。Julia 的 SparseArrays 标准库提供 CSC（压缩稀疏列）格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using SparseArrays&#10;&#10;# 构造三对角矩阵（1D 有限差分）&#10;n = 10000&#10;A = spdiagm(-1 =&gt; fill(-1.0, n-1),&#10;             0 =&gt; fill(2.0, n),&#10;             1 =&gt; fill(-1.0, n-1))&#10;&#10;# 直接用 \\ 求解 —— 自动选择稀疏 LU（UMFPACK）&#10;x = A \\ rand(n)&#10;&#10;# 显式使用 Cholesky（CHOLMOD）—— 对称正定稀疏&#10;F = cholesky(Symmetric(A))&#10;x = F \\ rand(n)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using SparseArrays</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 构造三对角矩阵（1D 有限差分）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>n = 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = spdiagm(-1 => fill(-1.0, n-1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             0 => fill(2.0, n),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             1 => fill(-1.0, n-1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 直接用 \\ 求解 —— 自动选择稀疏 LU（UMFPACK）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = A \\ rand(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 显式使用 Cholesky（CHOLMOD）—— 对称正定稀疏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>F = cholesky(Symmetric(A))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = F \\ rand(n)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[输入矩阵 A] --&gt; B{检测矩阵属性}&#10;    B --&gt;|对称正定| C[Cholesky&lt;br/&gt;CHOLMOD]&#10;    B --&gt;|一般稀疏| D[LU&lt;br/&gt;UMFPACK]&#10;    B --&gt;|对称不定| E[LDLᵀ&lt;br/&gt;LDLFactorizations.jl]&#10;    B --&gt;|带状结构| F[带状 LU&lt;br/&gt;BandedMatrices.jl]&#10;    C --&gt; G[求解 Ax=b]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{矩阵规模}&#10;    H --&gt;|n 大于 10⁵| I[迭代求解器&lt;br/&gt;IterativeSolvers.jl]&#10;    H --&gt;|n 小于 10⁵| J[直接求解器&lt;br/&gt;分解 + 回代]\">graph TD\n    A[输入矩阵 A] --&gt; B{检测矩阵属性}\n    B --&gt;|对称正定| C[Cholesky&lt;br/&gt;CHOLMOD]\n    B --&gt;|一般稀疏| D[LU&lt;br/&gt;UMFPACK]\n    B --&gt;|对称不定| E[LDLᵀ&lt;br/&gt;LDLFactorizations.jl]\n    B --&gt;|带状结构| F[带状 LU&lt;br/&gt;BandedMatrices.jl]\n    C --&gt; G[求解 Ax=b]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{矩阵规模}\n    H --&gt;|n 大于 10⁵| I[迭代求解器&lt;br/&gt;IterativeSolvers.jl]\n    H --&gt;|n 小于 10⁵| J[直接求解器&lt;br/&gt;分解 + 回代]</pre><p>BandedMatrices.jl 和 BlockBandedMatrices.jl 为带状和块带状结构提供了专用存储和算法，复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot b^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为带宽）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"迭代求解器与预条件\">迭代求解器与预条件</h2><p>当矩阵规模达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上且结构稀疏时，直接分解的内存和时间成本不再可接受。迭代方法通过矩阵-向量乘法（无需显式存储矩阵）逼近解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using IterativeSolvers, LinearMaps&#10;&#10;# Krylov 子空间方法：共轭梯度法（对称正定）&#10;x, history = cg(A, b; log=true, maxiter=1000, tol=1e-10)&#10;&#10;# GMRES（一般非对称）&#10;x, history = gmres(A, b; restart=30, maxiter=500)&#10;&#10;# 无矩阵方法：只需提供矩阵-向量乘的函数&#10;function matvec!(y, x)&#10;    # 可以是任意线性算子，无需显式矩阵&#10;    y .= some_operator(x)&#10;end&#10;L = LinearMap(matvec!, n; ismutating=true)&#10;x = gmres(L, b)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using IterativeSolvers, LinearMaps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Krylov 子空间方法：共轭梯度法（对称正定）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x, history = cg(A, b; log=true, maxiter=1000, tol=1e-10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># GMRES（一般非对称）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x, history = gmres(A, b; restart=30, maxiter=500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 无矩阵方法：只需提供矩阵-向量乘的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function matvec!(y, x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # 可以是任意线性算子，无需显式矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y .= some_operator(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>L = LinearMap(matvec!, n; ismutating=true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = gmres(L, b)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>迭代方法的收敛速度强烈依赖<strong>预条件</strong>（preconditioner）——一个近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的条件数接近 1。IncompleteLU.jl 和 AMGSolver.jl 提供常用预条件器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using IncompleteLU&#10;&#10;# 不完全 LU 预条件&#10;Pl = ilu(A; τ=1e-3)&#10;&#10;# 使用预条件的共轭梯度&#10;x = cg(A, b; Pl=Pl)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using IncompleteLU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 不完全 LU 预条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Pl = ilu(A; τ=1e-3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 使用预条件的共轭梯度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>x = cg(A, b; Pl=Pl)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"linearsolve-jl-统一线性求解接口\">LinearSolve.jl：统一线性求解接口</h2><p>SciML 生态的 LinearSolve.jl 提供了跨后端的统一接口——同一段代码可以在直接法、迭代法、GPU 求解器之间切换，只需改变算法参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using LinearSolve&#10;&#10;prob = LinearProblem(A, b)&#10;&#10;# 直接法&#10;sol = solve(prob, LUFactorization())&#10;&#10;# 迭代法&#10;sol = solve(prob, KrylovJL_GMRES())&#10;&#10;# GPU 加速&#10;sol = solve(prob, CudaOffloadFactorization())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using LinearSolve</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>prob = LinearProblem(A, b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 直接法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sol = solve(prob, LUFactorization())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 迭代法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sol = solve(prob, KrylovJL_GMRES())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># GPU 加速</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sol = solve(prob, CudaOffloadFactorization())</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LinearSolve.jl 在 2025 年完成了对 Julia <code>--trim</code> 静态编译的适配（sciml.ai），通过 <code>@static</code> 注解确保算法选择在编译期确定，使得包含线性求解的科学计算程序可以编译为独立二进制文件。这一改进对<a href=\"differential-equations\">微分方程求解</a>的部署场景尤为重要——隐式求解器的每个时间步都需要求解线性系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵函数与特殊运算\">矩阵函数与特殊运算</h2><p>科学计算中常需要计算矩阵指数（控制系统的状态转移）、矩阵对数（李群运算）、矩阵平方根等：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using LinearAlgebra&#10;&#10;A = rand(5, 5)&#10;&#10;# 矩阵指数：Padé 逼近 + scaling-and-squaring&#10;E = exp(A)&#10;&#10;# 矩阵对数&#10;L = log(E)  # 应近似等于 A&#10;&#10;# 矩阵平方根（对称正定）&#10;S = sqrt(Symmetric(A&#39;A))&#10;&#10;# 任意矩阵函数通过 Schur 分解计算&#10;using MatrixFunctions&#10;f_A = funm(A, sin)  # sin(A) 的矩阵意义\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using LinearAlgebra</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>A = rand(5, 5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 矩阵指数：Padé 逼近 + scaling-and-squaring</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>E = exp(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 矩阵对数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>L = log(E)  # 应近似等于 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 矩阵平方根（对称正定）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = sqrt(Symmetric(A'A))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 任意矩阵函数通过 Schur 分解计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>using MatrixFunctions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>f_A = funm(A, sin)  # sin(A) 的矩阵意义</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Kronecker 积在量子力学和张量网络中频繁出现，Julia 提供 <code>kron</code> 函数和 Kronecker.jl 包来高效处理而无需显式构造完整的大矩阵：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using Kronecker&#10;&#10;# 惰性 Kronecker 积——不显式构造 n²×n² 矩阵&#10;K = A ⊗ B  # 惰性对象&#10;y = K * x   # 利用 (A⊗B)vec(X) = vec(BXAᵀ) 的性质高效计算\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using Kronecker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 惰性 Kronecker 积——不显式构造 n²×n² 矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>K = A ⊗ B  # 惰性对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y = K * x   # 利用 (A⊗B)vec(X) = vec(BXAᵀ) 的性质高效计算</span></span></code></pre></div><p>理解线性代数的计算层级（BLAS Level 1/2/3）和存储格式选择，是高效使用<a href=\"optimization-mathematical-programming\">优化与数学规划</a>框架的前提——JuMP 模型的约束矩阵构造和求解器回调都建立在这些基础设施之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分解选择由矩阵结构决定</strong>：LU（一般方阵）、Cholesky（对称正定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3/6)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/6</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 最省）、QR（最小二乘）、SVD（秩分析与伪逆，精度最高）、Eigen/Schur（特征值与矩阵函数）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>factorize</code> 自动化这一判断</strong>：它读取 <code>Symmetric</code>、稀疏、带状等类型信息，经多重派发选中最优算法，用户无需手动指定。</li>\n<li><strong>分解-求解分离是性能分水岭</strong>：分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、回代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，多次不同右端项应复用同一个分解对象。</li>\n<li><strong>BLAS 调优的两个旋钮</strong>：线程数配置与矩阵尺寸阈值——小矩阵（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&lt;100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>）用 StaticArrays 栈分配更优，大矩阵在 Intel 平台上 MKL 常比 OpenBLAS 快 20–40%。</li>\n<li><strong>稀疏矩阵走结构专用路径</strong>：CSC 格式配 CHOLMOD/UMFPACK；带状矩阵用 BandedMatrices 把复杂度降至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\cdot b^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>大规模问题转向迭代与预条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n &gt; 10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 用 CG/GMRES 等 Krylov 方法，收敛速度由预条件器（不完全 LU、AMG）决定，LinearSolve.jl 则提供跨后端的统一接口。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数值线性代数与矩阵计算","id":"数值线性代数与矩阵计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稠密矩阵分解体系","id":"稠密矩阵分解体系"},{"level":2,"text":"BLAS 与 LAPACK 的底层接口","id":"blas-与-lapack-的底层接口"},{"level":2,"text":"稀疏矩阵与特殊结构","id":"稀疏矩阵与特殊结构"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代求解器与预条件","id":"迭代求解器与预条件"},{"level":2,"text":"LinearSolve.jl：统一线性求解接口","id":"linearsolve-jl-统一线性求解接口"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵函数与特殊运算","id":"矩阵函数与特殊运算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"元编程与宏系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/foundations/metaprogramming-macros"},"next":{"title":"微分方程求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific-computing/scientific-core/differential-equations"}}